                    {
                        "form_id": "68bd7b97-032a-4a7f-b83e-29e49a3c6a40",
                        "entry_id": "96d405df-aaca-374d-aa0b-e903bb3d82b4",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "экле́ктиках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4ede2a55-9b99-3dc9-8e4e-f854a0a2615c",
                        "entry_id": "96d405df-aaca-374d-aa0b-e903bb3d82b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. механическое, чисто внешнее смешение в одном целом разнородных, внутренне не соединимых частей (также взглядов, идей, принципов, точек зрения и т. п.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "58d04dec-e1d3-46be-86d6-e22ab7bf4148",
                                "sense_id": "4ede2a55-9b99-3dc9-8e4e-f854a0a2615c",
                                "text": "Не стоит забывать, что та старина, которой мы сегодня кланяемся, сама по себе сложилась достаточно случайно и в свое время была новаторством или эклектикой, раздражавшей, вероятно, многих."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "23dd8096-535d-3924-9346-77b1cc7cacfc",
                        "entry_id": "96d405df-aaca-374d-aa0b-e903bb3d82b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "архит. направление в архитектуре второй половины XIX века, сочетающее элементы различных стилей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fea2eba-42ec-4999-9356-24b05646a6b6",
                                "sense_id": "23dd8096-535d-3924-9346-77b1cc7cacfc",
                                "text": "Английское викторианство (период в истории Англии, связанный с правлением королевы Виктории) открыло путь эклектике в архитектуре и дало толчок развитию садового (gardenesque) стиля."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "043e5643-ae42-4a5f-a53d-cd0e3a27bb82",
                        "source_entry_id": "96d405df-aaca-374d-aa0b-e903bb3d82b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "eclecticism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "eclecticism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "edf5de69-5636-34fc-a2e5-97022cd49fe2",
                                        "entry_id": "3ceed69a-9e64-3553-9be8-1a84c7ced64e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being eclectic"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c04adf62-32dc-47d8-89de-2d1381ea6962",
                                                "sense_id": "edf5de69-5636-34fc-a2e5-97022cd49fe2",
                                                "text": "In those days she had admired his pluralistic openness of mind, and struggled, in her kitchen, towards a parallel eclecticism, learning to cook the dosas and uttapams of South India as well as the soft meatballs of Kashmir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff947766-6b35-4267-baf1-6307adc898cc",
                                                "sense_id": "edf5de69-5636-34fc-a2e5-97022cd49fe2",
                                                "text": "I am concerned that this encouraging but brief period of success will foster the opinion, already widely held, that the monetary pillar is superfluous, and lead monetary policy analysis back to the kind of muddled eclecticism that brought us the 1970s inflation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "987ec297-fadc-3e40-b80e-bcf44930232b",
                                        "entry_id": "3ceed69a-9e64-3553-9be8-1a84c7ced64e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An approach to thought that draws upon multiple theories to gain complementary insights into phenomena"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "772e0e85-694a-3c84-a19a-dabc8bf9a1b0",
                                        "entry_id": "3ceed69a-9e64-3553-9be8-1a84c7ced64e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any form of art that borrows from multiple other styles"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "37ba133f-be43-4faf-9fa7-b0fc861c1e9e",
                        "source_entry_id": "96d405df-aaca-374d-aa0b-e903bb3d82b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "Eklektizismus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Eklektizismus",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4516ce0-1ac5-34aa-b192-3ee37c30cbc4",
                                        "entry_id": "ad923e3a-2e2d-32c1-a506-6b26fe535b45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inbegriff dafür, unterschiedliche, jeweils abgeschlossene Systeme (beispielsweise Kunststile oder Denkschulen verschiedener Traditionen beziehungsweise Zeiten) neu zusammenzufügen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d2c8731-b522-408e-87fe-cb893df9a238",
                                                "sense_id": "d4516ce0-1ac5-34aa-b192-3ee37c30cbc4",
                                                "text": "Die Kirche St. Augustin in Paris ist ein Beispiel für Eklektizismus: Die Fassade mit Fensterrose und Skulpturengalerie folgt dem gotischen Stil, während sich die Kuppel an der Renaissance orientiert."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "16f2973b-36b0-40c3-89b4-cbabed918cb2",
                        "source_entry_id": "96d405df-aaca-374d-aa0b-e903bb3d82b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "éclectisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "éclectisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0b3ef9b-4336-34e9-94e7-dd560147e15f",
                                        "entry_id": "471c687e-07ea-3103-8d78-ec446bf88607",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Philosophie éclectique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c89fc42-4608-4513-a70c-d831241d976f",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b3ef9b-4336-34e9-94e7-dd560147e15f",
                                                "text": "L'orientation des esprits change à peine deux fois par siècle. La philosophie universitaire, par exemple, ayant secoué la tradition de l'éclectisme, explique depuis cela le catéchisme de Koenigsberg et récuse toute idée nouvelle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0246376c-d7ef-4c94-9c97-586a1e31b300",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b3ef9b-4336-34e9-94e7-dd560147e15f",
                                                "text": "Or, ce qui manque à l’éclectisme, c'est justement une base scientifique et positive; et ses prétendus dogmes ne sont pas moins arbitraires et cérébrins que les dogmes des églises."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52e4a7d7-d9d4-343b-bf44-7d5e5c8f38cd",
                                        "entry_id": "471c687e-07ea-3103-8d78-ec446bf88607",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Disposition d’esprit qui consiste à se garder de toute vue étroite et systématique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "509697ac-0e01-4d2d-ba44-24384d1a8196",
                                                "sense_id": "52e4a7d7-d9d4-343b-bf44-7d5e5c8f38cd",
                                                "text": "La rivalité entre les deux chaînes d’État, dont l’une ne diffuse que des émissions éducatives, et les cinq chaînes privées permet un grand éclectisme dans les programmes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64ec13f8-d3e4-4bae-9121-8dccf1a105ba",
                                                "sense_id": "52e4a7d7-d9d4-343b-bf44-7d5e5c8f38cd",
                                                "text": "Un aimable éclectisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdc8490f-8c9f-4648-95e5-d93e05052b33",
                                                "sense_id": "52e4a7d7-d9d4-343b-bf44-7d5e5c8f38cd",
                                                "text": "Éclectisme de l’homme du monde."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
